<title>FRANCE: Havas 1996 net attrib profit up 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Havas 1996 net attrib profit up 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable after goodwill	1,000  vs	     886</p>
<p>    Net attrib before goodwill	     1,217  vs	   1,112</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)     19  vs	    17.5</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     8.50  vs	    8.50</p>
<p>    Operating				    1,562  vs	   1,565</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					2,072  vs	   2,212</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     2,204  vs	   1,992</p>
<p>    Investments				  2,428  vs	   8,599</p>
<p>    Turnover				    48,607  vs	  44,626</p>
<p>PARIS - Havas issued its 1996 results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it had an exceptional gain last year of 266 million francs, compared with a gain of 10 million for the preceding year, due partly to capital gains on the sales of Telestar and part of its stake in Capital Radio.</p>
<p>Equity rose five percent to 12.89 billion francs.</p>
<p>The board will propose a net dividend of 8.50 francs at the annual general meeting on June 26. Shareholders may take their payment in cash or shares, it said in the statement.</p>
<p>Havas had issued estimates of its profit, before and after goodwill amortisation, on February 6.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
